slv : eps_cv_volume       [cv] = | SUM_{i}{ SUM( S[f] * n[f][i] * crd[f][i] ) } / 3 - V[cv] | / V[cv],
slv :                            where "i" is axis (x, y, z) and "f" is cv's face (of any type),
slv :                            crd[f] is coordinate of face "f" in cv-centered coordinate system, i.e. shifted by -crd[cv].
